Beta 1.7.3 Rust Mods

This repository holds unofficial ports of other people's Minecraft mods and
a few original mods. I do not own Minecraft or the mods ported here.
Minecraft belongs to Mojang AB and Microsoft Corporation, and each ported
mod belongs to its original authors. None of them are affiliated with or
endorse this project.

There is no single license for the repository. Each mod folder has its own
LICENSE file:

  aether            LGPL-3.0, following the original Aether Legacy code
  rei               MIT, following the original Roughly Enough Items
  discs, spc        MIT, original code
  buildcraft, ic2,
  twilightforest,
  wirelessredstone  free non-commercial use notice, rights stay with the
                    original authors

Original mod art and sounds are never committed. The game builds them from
copies of the original mods the player supplies.

If you are a rights holder and object to any part of this repository,
contact the author through the repository and it will be taken down.
